  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a Legal Information Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected impact of the Project is to strengthen rule of law and improve access to information about laws in effect in the Republic of Kosovo.
The expected effects for the target group of the Project are: Improved access to current, correct and understandable information about legislation in effect in Kosovo through the Legal Information System; Discrepancies between legislation in Serbian and Albanian language are corrected and a system is created to avoid future inconsistencies.</narrative>
  </description>
